  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "DSH Discord User Assistant & MCP Plugin (`@luoyi-dsh/discord-plugin`)",
      "text": "<div align=\"center\">\n\n**[English](README.md) | [繁體中文](README.zh-Hant.md) | [Agent & Operational Guide](AGENTS.md)**\n\n</div>"
    },
    {
      "section": "DSH Discord User Assistant & MCP Plugin (`@luoyi-dsh/discord-plugin`)",
      "text": "> A specialized smart assistant and Model Context Protocol (MCP) plugin designed for **Discord User Accounts (Selfbot)**.  \n> Fully integrated into the DeepSeek Harness (DSH) ecosystem, featuring two autonomous engines: **Mention, Quote & DM Assistant** and **Autonomous Co-Chatting**, alongside a complete suite of **13 MCP tools** covering text, images, files, stickers, and emoji reactions.  \n> Features native support for **DSH Platform Subscriptions (Antigravity, Codex, Grok)** for zero-API-key operation, and automatic seamless fallback when external API quotas are exhausted (HTTP 402 Insufficient Balance)."
    },
    {
      "section": "DSH Discord User Assistant & MCP Plugin (`@luoyi-dsh/discord-plugin`)",
      "text": "---"
    },
    {
      "section": "🌟 Key Features",
      "text": "1. **User Account Driven (Selfbot Engine)**:\n   - Uses user authorization tokens (not official bot tokens).\n   - Simulates human online presence states (`online`, `idle`, `dnd`, `invisible`).\n   - Supports HTTP and SOCKS5 outbound proxies.\n2. **Smart Reply Engine (Mentions, Quotes & DMs)**:\n   - **@Mentions & Quote Replies**: Automatically extracts recent channel conversation context and synthesizes reasoned responses under your identity.\n   - **Direct Message (DM) Assistant**: Handles 1-on-1 private inquiries autonomously.\n   - **Round Cap Protection**: Limits sequential conversational rounds per user to prevent infinite bot-to-bot loops.\n3. **Autonomous Co-Chatting (Group Conversations)**:\n   - **Real-time Gateway Monitoring**: Maintains sliding message buffers across active channels.\n   - **Context-Aware Participation**: Weighs interest keywords, question detection, probability triggers, and channel-specific cooldowns to engage naturally in discussions.\n   - **`[NO_REPLY]` Introspection**: LLM autonomously drops out if discussions are deemed sensitive, private, or inappropriate to interrupt.\n4. **Anti-Ban Safety System**:\n   - **Human Typing Indicators (`sendTyping`)**: Sends ty"
    },
    {
      "section": "🌟 Key Features",
      "text": "---"
    },
    {
      "section": "🚀 Installation",
      "text": "```bash"
    },
    {
      "section": "Via DSH Plugin CLI (Recommended)",
      "text": "dsh plugin --profile web add @luoyi-dsh/discord-plugin"
    },
    {
      "section": "Or via NPM",
      "text": "npm install @luoyi-dsh/discord-plugin\n```\n\n---"
    },
    {
      "section": "📖 Operational Guide & Tool Reference",
      "text": "For complete MCP tool definitions, natural language prompts, HTTP REST API routes, SDK invocation examples, and configuration parameters, please refer to **[AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md)**.\n\n---"
    },
    {
      "section": "📁 Directory Structure",
      "text": "```text\ndsh-discord-plugin/\n├── assets/\n│   └── banner.png                 # Promotional banner\n├── client.js                      # DSH Web UI dashboard\n\n---"
    },
